[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H1FWHVPS-24
TITLE: High voltage setpoint 2 - Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
When the system is powered, the service user should check the reported value of high voltage
which should be > 10 kV with loaded treatment plan.
<<<
PREREQUISITES: >>>
