2. Load a treatment plan.
3. Check the status of the system.
4. Look for value of the reported high voltage.
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
1. Verify the system is powered on successfully.
2. Verify the plan is loaded successfully.
3. Verify the status of the system is ready.
